<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 45.124  ATLAS</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">By Glenn Klein</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="266">Angles for R.I. = 1.830</tspan>
